sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Analyst
    participant W as webapp
    participant R as redis
    participant E as elasticsearch
    participant M as mongodb
    A->>W: GET /search (text, level, service, dates)
    W->>R: check session and rate limit
    W->>R: GET cache:search:hash
    alt cache hit
        R-->>W: cached results
    else cache miss
        W->>E: search (bool query, sort, size 50)
        E-->>W: hits and total
        W->>R: SETEX cache:search:hash 60 results
    end
    W->>M: insert search history
    W-->>A: results table and total count
    opt export to CSV
        A->>W: GET /api/v1/logs?format=csv
        W->>E: scroll through all matching logs
        W-->>A: CSV file
    end
